---
const categories = ['Island cruises','Snorkelling','Culture & villages','Adventure','Fishing','Nature'];
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<meta name="description" content="Discover Fiji tours and experiences from independent local operators. Transparent FJD prices and direct booking requests." />
<title>BulaBooking | Discover Fiji. Book Local. Pay Later.</title>
<style>
:root{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;color:#143238;background:#f6fbfa}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}a{color:inherit}header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px max(5%,calc((100% - 1100px)/2));background:#fff}header strong{font-size:1.35rem;color:#087b73}nav{display:flex;gap:20px}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:0 24px}.hero{padding:85px 0 65px;max-width:780px}.eyebrow{font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#087b73;font-size:.8rem}h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,6vw,5rem);line-height:1.07;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:20px 0}h2{font-size:2rem;letter-spacing:-.025em}p{line-height:1.6;color:#4a6468}.cta{display:inline-block;padding:15px 22px;border-radius:12px;background:#087b73;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;margin:10px 10px 0 0}.cta.alt{background:white;color:#087b73;border:1px solid #a9d5d0}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.tile{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d7e8e5;border-radius:18px;padding:24px;min-height:125px}.tile strong{font-size:1.1rem}section{margin:35px 0 75px}.notice{background:#e7f4f1;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;font-size:.9rem}footer{padding:35px 24px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid #d7e8e5}@media(max-width:650px){nav{gap:10px;font-size:.85rem}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.hero{padding:60px 0 35px}}@media(max-width:400px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><strong>BulaBooking<span style="color:#e99b37">.</span></strong><nav aria-label="Main"><a href="#explore">Explore</a><a href="#operators">For operators</a></nav></header>
<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">Fiji experiences, local connections</div><h1>Discover Fiji.<br/>Book local.<br/>Pay later.</h1><p>Find tours and experiences from independent Fiji operators, with transparent prices in Fijian dollars. A new Fiji marketplace is being prepared.</p><a class="cta" href="#explore">Explore experiences</a><a class="cta alt" href="#operators">List your experience</a></section>
<section id="explore"><h2>Explore Fiji your way</h2><div class="grid">{categories.map(category => <article class="tile"><strong>{category}</strong><p>Operator experiences coming soon</p></article>)}</div><p class="notice">Preview only. No live listings, availability, prices or booking checkout are active.</p></section>
<section id="operators"><div class="eyebrow">Built for Fiji operators</div><h2>Your business. Your prices. Your customers.</h2><p>Open to qualifying Fiji operators, including those competing with our affiliated travel businesses. Proposed benefits include zero tour commissions, AI-assisted listing creation, direct booking requests and mobile operator tools.</p><p>Operator registration and verification are not yet active. Never submit personal documents to this preview.</p></section>
<section><h2>Getting around Fiji</h2><p>Dedicated transfer bookings are planned through affiliated NAT/FijiDash services. Tours with their own included pickup remain welcome. No transfer checkout is active in this preview.</p></section>
</main><footer>© BulaBooking · Fiji-focused marketplace prototype · Not accepting bookings</footer>
</body></html>